  "body": "Blink and WebKit support these additional aliases for UTF-8 and UTF-16:\r\n\r\nUTF-8:\r\n* unicode11utf8\r\n* unicode20utf8\r\n* x-unicode20utf8\r\n\r\nUTF-16LE\r\n* csunicode\r\n* ucs-2\r\n* unicode\r\n* iso-10646-ucs-2\r\n* unicodefeff\r\n\r\nUTF-16BE\r\n* unicodefffe\r\n\r\n(Usable via TextDecoder constructor and the various declarative mechanisms)\r\n\r\nThe usage is presumably small, but we don't have actual numbers. And I'm lazy. Should we just go ahead and add them?",
